#: energy.cpp:154
msgid ""
"<h1>Display Power Control</h1> <p>If your display supports power saving "
"features, you can configure them using this module.</p> <p>There are three "
"levels of power saving: standby, suspend, and off. The greater the level of "
"power saving, the longer it takes for the display to return to an active "
"state.</p> <p>To wake up the display from a power saving mode, you can make "
"a small movement with the mouse, or press a key that is not likely to cause "
"any unintentional side-effects, for example, the \"Shift\" key.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Siłkavańnie ekranu</h1> <p>Kali tvoj ekran umieje kiravać enerhijaj, "
"tady ty možaš naładzić tut hetuju mahčymaść.</p> <p>Jość try roŭni "
"zachoŭvańnia enerhii: čakańnie, son i vyklučeńnie. Čym bolš aščadny rovień, "
"tym daŭžejšy termin času, patrebny ekranu dla ŭznaŭleńnia zvykłaj raboty.</"
"p> <p>Kab viarnuć ekran u dziejny stan, možaš pasunuć kursor albo nacisnuć "
"jakuju-niebudź klavišu, jakaja nia zrobić ničoha niečakanaha, naprykład, "
"„Shift”.</p>"

#: energy.cpp:176
msgid "&Enable display power management"
msgstr "&Uklučy kiravańnie enerhijaj ekrana"

#: energy.cpp:179
msgid "Check this option to enable the power saving features of your display."
msgstr ""
"Uklučy hetuju opcyju, kab zadziejničać mahčymaści ekanomii enerhii tvajho "
"ekrana."

#: energy.cpp:182
msgid "Your display does not support power saving."
msgstr "Tvoj ekran nie absłuhoŭvaje ekanomiju enerhii."

#: energy.cpp:190
msgid "Learn more about the Energy Star program"
msgstr "Bolš źviestak ab prahramie „Energy Star”"

#: energy.cpp:200
msgid "&Standby after:"
msgstr "&Čakaj paśla:"

#: energy.cpp:202 energy.cpp:213 energy.cpp:225
msgid " min"
msgstr " chvilin"

#: energy.cpp:203
msgctxt "Disables display entering standby mode after x min"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Vyklučana"

#: energy.cpp:206
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"standby\" mode. This is the first level of power saving."
msgstr ""
"Vybiery termin biaździejnaści, paśla jakoha ekran pavinien stać u čakańni. "
"Heta pieršy rovień zachoŭvańnia enerhii."

#: energy.cpp:211
msgid "S&uspend after:"
msgstr "&Zaśni paśla:"

#: energy.cpp:214
msgctxt "Disables display entering suspend mode after x min"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Vyklučana"

#: energy.cpp:217
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"suspend\" mode. This is the second level of power saving, but may not be "
"different from the first level for some displays."
msgstr ""
"Vybiery termin biaździejnaści, paśla jakoha ekran pavinien stać u spańni. "
"Heta druhi rovień zachoŭvańnia enerhii, ale dla niekatorych ekranaŭ jon nia "
"roźnicca ź pieršym."

#: energy.cpp:223
msgid "&Power off after:"
msgstr "&Vyklučy paśla:"

#: energy.cpp:226
msgctxt "Disables display being turned off after x min"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Vyklučana"

#: energy.cpp:229
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should be powered "
"off. This is the greatest level of power saving that can be achieved while "
"the display is still physically turned on."
msgstr ""
"Vybiery termin biaździejnaści, paśla jakoha ekran pavinien vyklučycca. Heta "
"najbolšy rovień zachoŭvańnia enerhii, jakoha možna siahnuć, nie adłučajučy "
"ekran fizyčna ad siłkavańnia."
